UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|This worked out okay for EW anyway, but that is unusual in this type of auction.  In general you do not want to let the opponents play at the 2-level when they have an 8-card fit and the points are even between the two sides. As it turns out, they can't make 3@H which is what would have been the contract had East balanced with a double.|
