mb|P?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|My hand has 18 HCP, 2 length points, 1 quality suit point for a total of 21 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenstartingpoints,Bergen Starting Points^*N|CP||FP||at|. Then declarer addons of 2 for the singleton and 1 for the 4+ card side club suit make my hand 24 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at|.That means in theory we could have slam if North has a maximum and enough key cards though unlikely. So I am just going to bid a conservative 4@H.|
