nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North has problems to lead. Leading away from a king can be dangerous. So are leading away from a jack or leading a singleton trump. There is a very small inference not to lead a diamond, although often it does not hold. And that is, if I had good diamonds I might double 3@D. However, diamonds turns out to be a great lead.|
